1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,924
The sphere's area is four pi r squared, so I equals P over four pi r squared.

2
00:00:05,924 --> 00:00:09,101
Intensity falls as one over r squared.

3
00:00:09,101 --> 00:00:15,494
That is the inverse square law, and it is why you have to stand close to hear someone speaking softly.

